 Oh, it's just fizzing
with excitement, you know?

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.710
 It's like coming into halftime
when a game's already going

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.540
and you jump in and it's
like, I got to keep up.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.530
I got to keep up.

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:24.860
 He's been to space.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.650
He's become Spider-Man.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.120
He's lost his mentor.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.800
And now his identity
is revealed.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.200
And all he wants to do
is graduate high school

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.160
and go to college.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.920
 I'm not sure that
these people realize

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.150
that I'm not in this movie.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.800
I'm not going to burst
their bubble for them.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.660
 What are you looking
forward to seeing

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:41.680
most in this film tonight?

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:44.140
 Well, number one,
my homies Benedict

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.760
Cumberbatch and Benny Wong.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:47.470
Got to support the crew.

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:49.300
 Got an email from
Kevin Feige saying

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:53.830
it's fast becoming the WCU,
so I'll I'll take that.

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:56.260
Wong Cinematic
Universe, I like it.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:57.670
I like it definitely.

00:00:57.670 --> 00:00:59.930
 I get to play the grown
up surrounded by kids.

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:01.280
I can say that.
They're half my age.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.080
They are kids.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.940
 Does Ned get to get on
the action on this one?

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:06.070
 Oh my goodness, like
you wouldn't believe.

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:08.060
Ned and MJ are killing it.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:08.860
 Yes!

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.210
 How did it feel to be a
web slinging and flying high?

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:12.010
 Oh, man.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:13.040
It was so much fun.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:14.560
I loved being able
to do that stuff.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.400
I'm not afraid of
heights in that way.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.950
So I feel really good about it.

