00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.010
by a toilet flushing.

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:40.450
 How does he inspire you?

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:43.000
 I bring him to
red carpet events.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.920
 So who are you
excited to see tonight?

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:47.210
 That kid to play Spider-Man,
whatever his name is.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:47.755
 What?
Who?

00:01:47.755 --> 00:01:51.340
 And, you know,
the 75 bad guys.

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:52.840
 When I first heard
the idea for the movie,

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.220
I thought this is impossible.

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:55.600
 At the time, I was
like, there's no way

