00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:01.870
and make it make sense.

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:02.770
But they did.

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:04.570
 Oh, it's always
good to be a bad guy.

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:05.940
It's good being bad.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:08.919
 It's great to be a part
of it, see some old friends,

00:02:08.919 --> 00:02:10.630
see some new friends, you know?

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.220
 I'm just ready--

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:16.050
ready for all of you
to know what I know.

